<!-- Available mapping type: 
	1 Remove Usage
	2 Convert Usage
	3 Convert or Remove Usage depending on metaclass (default : Convert)
	4 ConvertUsage and Element type
	5.Convert Usage depending on metaclass.
	mapping type 1 required attribute: source
	mapping type 2 required attributes: source, target
		inner element (optional): tag [to specify tag values to be removed]
	mapping type 3 required attributes: source, target
		inner element: metaClass [to specify action according to metaClass type]
	mapping type 4 required attributes: source, target, sourceMetaClass, targetMetaClass
	mapping type 5 required attributes: source, target
		inner element (optional): custom [to specify action according to metaClass type]
		required attribute for inner elements (optional):
		- sourceMetaClass : to specify which BaseType need to be changed to targetMetaClass.
		- targetMetaClass : to specify targetMetaClass.
		- suffix : to specify the suffix of baseType's id. 
		
		Example. see rule of SysML1.1:probability.
	
-->
